<!-- CONDENSED PERSUASION (why networks · what happens · under the hood) -->
<section class="gr-why">
  <div class="gar-v2-inner">
    <p class="gr-why-lead">The agentic internet isn't five years away — it's reading the web today, and the businesses already on agent-readable networks are the ones being discovered.</p>
    <div class="gr-why-grid">
      <div class="gr-col">
        <h3 class="gr-col-h">Why networks win</h3>
        <p class="gr-col-body">A business optimizing alone is almost invisible. Inside the AICV network it's signal — AI systems reach for trusted regional context, not scattered noise. The network that earns the cluster earns the citation, and your record inherits the lift.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gr-col">
        <h3 class="gr-col-h">What happens when you join</h3>
        <ol class="gr-steps">
